 "we received requests from both indian and international headquarters!": {
  "file": "veth-48544ca60f.m4a",
  "ms": 4014,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "let's add commas according to each number system to make the reports easier to read.": {
  "file": "veth-acfd695837.m4a",
  "ms": 4722,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "the indian and international number systems group digits in different ways.": {
  "file": "veth-31c37426d6.m4a",
  "ms": 4490,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "indian number system uses thousands, lakhs and crores to read large numbers.": {
  "file": "veth-87bdf2d355.m4a",
  "ms": 5129,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "start from the right. count three digits and put a comma. this is the ones group.": {
  "file": "veth-c8c3b96016.m4a",
  "ms": 5127,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "now, count two digits and put another comma. this is the thousands group.": {
  "file": "veth-d6db18900e.m4a",
  "ms": 4676,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "next, count two more digits for the lakhs group. the remaining digit belongs to the crores group.": {
  "file": "veth-f1bc5dcaa5.m4a",
  "ms": 6011,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "we read this as four crore thirty-two lakh fifty-six thousand seven hundred eighty-one.": {
  "file": "veth-23b702dc83.m4a",
  "ms": 5151,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "the international number system uses thousands, millions and billions. here, commas follow a different pattern.": {
  "file": "veth-664c9d1a7a.m4a",
  "ms": 7381,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "start from the right again. count three digits and put a comma. this is the ones group.": {
  "file": "veth-56f96753e2.m4a",
  "ms": 5510,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "now count three more digits and place another comma. this is the thousands group.": {
  "file": "veth-f4bad763da.m4a",
  "ms": 4815,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "the remaining digits belong to the millions group. for even bigger numbers, we use billions.": {
  "file": "veth-ca6feec93a.m4a",
  "ms": 5744,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "we read this as forty-three million two hundred fifty-six thousand seven hundred eighty-one.": {
  "file": "veth-685047a613.m4a",
  "ms": 5256,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "in the indian number system, we group the last three digits first, then the remaining digits in pairs of two.": {
  "file": "veth-691dd41f1e.m4a",
  "ms": 6673,
  "who": "veth"
 },
 "in the international number system, we group digits in sets of three throughout.": {
  "file": "veth-7ca2258c72.m4a",
  "ms": 4839,
  "who": "veth"
 },
